#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:5
#: af6977734bc64c4f9e8846c598c72a3b
msgid "MicoAir MTF-01 Optical Flow Sensor"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:9
#: 86b382f8b0204010a0df45c521ade65c
msgid "The is a lightweight 2 in 1 optical flow sensor including a short range lidar which uses the serial MAVLink protocol to communicate with the autopilot.  This can be used to improve horizontal position control especially in GPS denied  or indoor environments."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:16
#: c50c2c07d9db46c880c9b3069f4d2d0d
msgid "Where to Buy"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:18
#: 82c8ec9ea29e4a679a569bfaa9225ee4
msgid "The sensor is available from `Aliexpress <https://www.aliexpress.us/item/3256805359467554.html>`__ and other resellers"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:21
#: 45e8454e94a74979a5324666fcaf0cff
msgid "Sensor Setup"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:23
#: 66ba844cdff7437691c773bfb436b92d
msgid "Use MicoAir's MicoAssistant software using an FTDI adapter (USB to serial) to set its output protocol to \"mav-apm\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:30
#: 8a9d8b1bf6a341bea6464dbb9e2a317a
msgid "With firmware versions 4.5.0 or above, MTF-01 may not be recognized by Ardupilot unless you  use MicoAssistant to modify its “mav_id” to 200(any value other than 1) and configure whichever serial port's ``SERIALx_OPTIONS`` its connected to  on the autopilot from \"0\" to \"1024\"(“Don’t forward mavlink to/from” option)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:33
#: 1b5503d6b2af48edb219bd5cb5eb90c7
msgid "Connection to Autopilot"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:39
#: c7538a136d034cf5a7e6d1cfd58bfc75
msgid "The flow sensor should be mounted on the underside of the copter with the camera lens pointing downwards."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:40
#: b52554debc9d4c8d885d4b111399be42
msgid "Connect the sensor to the autopilots' serial port"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:43
#: a2bacfd943df4ed68bc60e89d26e69b1
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:44
#: c834e833f053448390a87619d99b741c
msgid "For the following we will assume it will be connected to Serial1 port of the autopilot. Any serial port can be used, however."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:46
#: a7a2a146ad994ec0b2176257cdd344d1
msgid "Set :ref:`SERIAL1_BAUD<SERIAL1_BAUD>` = 115"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:47
#: 86a47f0a9b2c4aca929c426d73a084db
msgid "Set :ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL<SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` = 1 (MAVLink1)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:48
#: 8608df53ff284db3acdb295a1ce3d885
msgid "Set :ref:`FLOW_TYPE<FLOW_TYPE>` = 5 (MAVLink)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:49
#: 9c78ce9e3c84481b9a848e00379220f1
msgid "Set :ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE<RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 10 (MAVLink)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:50
#: 88b00e90680c4801af30bde8636cbe83
msgid "Reboot autopilot to see rangefinder parameters"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:51
#: 787475c7be34455c87bcd47971aab875
msgid "Set :ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = 8 to set range finder's maximum range to 8m"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:52
#: 2ef2eeeded8e4a708fbf0e3bfbe97d4c
msgid "Set :ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` = 0.01"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:53
#: f3b9c9d1052b49588d100ffbd9fc47c0
msgid "Set :ref:`RNGFND1_ORIENT<RNGFND1_ORIENT>` = 25 (Downward)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:55
#: 68166cdfee5d4e0f85d14d41765b1183
msgid "Once the sensor is active you should be able to observe the optical flow and range sensor data on the Mission Planner’s “Status” page. The “opt_qua” and “rangefinder1” should have some value."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:58
#: dbd5e249dee7494b867f4ceab5dde980
msgid "Optical Flow Use and Calibration"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:60
#: 9553020a6f25442aa153b9c4ec9ee138
msgid "Be sure to follow the setup and calibration instructions and parameters for :ref:`Optical Flow setup <common-optical-flow-sensor-setup>` and how to switch between outdoor(GPS) and indoor (Optical Flow) positioning."
msgstr ""
